# Riba Iren (29018), a level 1 monster, sees a level 10 character, more than 8 levels above it,
# cast Ultimate Debuff (4694) on a monster beside it: it wants its mute (4215) on the character at
# 1000000. The character's combat draws are pinned so the debuff lands.
character Hunter 10
skill 4694 1
roll player 0
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.boss.orfen.OrfenPrivateRibaIren
npc riba 29018 Monster 250 0 0 skill DEBUFF_A 4215 1
npc wolf 20120 Monster 150 0 0

cast wolf 4694
  S MagicSkillUse caster=player target=wolf skill=4694-1 hit=0 reuse=0 success=0
  S SystemMessage id=46 4:4694,1
  desires riba cast(player,4215,move)=1000000
